---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

---

<BaseLayout title="Nivedita Pandey | Applied AI & Digital Innovation Leader" description="Applied AI, Digital Innovation, and Strategic Growth Leader. 16 years across enterprise, fintech, and government in the US, UK, Singapore, and India. Founder of Dendrons.ai.">
  <Fragment slot="head">
    <script type="application/ld+json">{JSON.stringify({
      "@context": "https://schema.org",
      "@type": "Person",
      "name": "Nivedita Pandey",
      "url": "https://www.niveditapandey.com",
      "image": "https://www.niveditapandey.com/images/PolkaDress.JPG",
      "jobTitle": "Applied AI & Digital Innovation Leader",
      "worksFor": {
        "@type": "Organization",
        "name": "Dendrons.ai",
        "url": "https://dendrons.ai"
      },
      "alumniOf": [
        { "@type": "CollegeOrUniversity", "name": "Wharton School, University of Pennsylvania" },
        { "@type": "CollegeOrUniversity", "name": "Institute of Rural Management Anand" }
      ],
      "sameAs": [
        "https://x.com/curious_NP",
        "https://github.com/niveditapandey",
        "https://dendrons.ai"
      ],
      "description": "Applied AI, Digital Innovation, and Strategic Growth Leader. 16 years across enterprise, fintech, and government in the US, UK, Singapore, and India."
    })}</script>
  </Fragment>
  <div class="home">
    <section class="hero">
      <div class="hero-banner">
        <img
          src="/images/hero-professional.png"
          alt="Nivedita Pandey"
          class="hero-banner-img"
        />
      </div>
      <h1 class="hero-title">
        Applied AI, Digital Innovation, and Strategic Growth Leader
      </h1>
      <p class="hero-text">
        From Big Tech to Central Bank Innovation - 16 years across enterprise, consumer, fintech, and private capital backed growth-stage companies in the US, UK, Singapore, and India.
      </p>
      <div class="stat-bar">
        <div class="stat"><span class="stat-number">$130M+</span><span class="stat-label">B2B revenue built from zero</span></div>
        <div class="stat"><span class="stat-number">268%</span><span class="stat-label">YoY portfolio revenue growth</span></div>
        <div class="stat"><span class="stat-number">$124M</span><span class="stat-label">B2C GMV</span></div>
        <div class="stat"><span class="stat-number">408</span><span class="stat-label">Civil servants trained on AI</span></div>
        <div class="stat"><span class="stat-number">4.81/5</span><span class="stat-label">AI workshop rating</span></div>
        <div class="stat"><span class="stat-number">5 markets</span><span class="stat-label">3 continents</span></div>
        <div class="stat"><span class="stat-number">15+</span><span class="stat-label">Multi-million dollar deals</span></div>
        <div class="stat"><span class="stat-number">50%+</span><span class="stat-label">Deal conversion lift</span></div>
        <div class="stat"><span class="stat-number">10M+</span><span class="stat-label">Customers acquired</span></div>
        <div class="stat"><span class="stat-number">49</span><span class="stat-label">AI prototypes with government</span></div>
        <div class="stat"><span class="stat-number">#1 in India</span><span class="stat-label">Program outcomes, national rollout</span></div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="bio">
      <p>
        I build products, platforms, verticals, and strategic initiatives at the intersection of technology, business, and impact - and I've done it across the public and private sector, from fintech to central bank innovation, from luxury consumer goods to government AI.
      </p>
      <p>
        I've founded startups twice before reaching this one. The first was incubated at UPenn through a US National Science Foundation-backed program (2015); the second through Antler VC in Singapore (2019).
      </p>
      <p>
        In between and alongside, I chose intrapreneurial roles - first-of-their-kind positions inside organisations that didn't have these functions before, and made them into blueprints of category-defining success.
      </p>
      <p>
        I founded Microsoft's PE/VC partnerships vertical across JAPAC and scaled it to $130M. Launched Asia's first digital gold fintech product from zero to $124M GMV. As a Prime Minister's Fellow on Digital Public Infrastructure, my pilot and scaleup of the programme achieved the highest success rate ahead of all state-level rollouts nationally, including Delhi. And advised the Reserve Bank Innovation Hub on AI use-cases and global growth strategy.
      </p>
      <p>
        As an architect and builder, I build verticals and the teams that run them - from founding-stage units (team strength 5) to cross-organisational programmes at scale (team strength 100).
      </p>
      <p>
        I hold an MBA from The Wharton School as a Joseph Wharton Fellow (merit-based fellowship), and a Computer Science Engineering degree with distinction where I ranked 1st in a class of 600 (placed on the Dean's List across the entire University).
      </p>

      <div class="dendrons-card">
        <div class="dendrons-card-top">
          <a href="https://dendrons.ai" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="dendrons-name">Dendrons.ai ↗</a>
          <span class="dendrons-type">Agentic AI · Founder</span>
        </div>
        <p class="dendrons-tagline">My third venture, and the one I've been building toward.</p>
        <div class="dendrons-card-badges">
          <span class="dendrons-pill">Google Cloud for Startups</span>
          <span class="dendrons-pill dendrons-pill--anthropic">Anthropic Claude Partner Network</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <p class="bio-contact">
        <a href="mailto:NiveditaPandey@alumni.upenn.edu">NiveditaPandey@alumni.upenn.edu</a>
      </p>

      <div class="hero-links">
        <a href="/projects" class="hero-link">Past Work →</a>
        <a href="/building" class="hero-link">Currently Building →</a>
        <a href="https://github.com/niveditapandey" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="hero-link">GitHub →</a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .home {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    max-width: 750px;
  }

  .hero {
    padding-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }

  .hero-banner {
    width: 100%;
    height: 380px;
    overflow: hidden;
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }

  .hero-banner-img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    object-position: center 20%;
    display: block;
  }

  .hero-title {
    font-size: 2.25rem;
    line-height: 1.25;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    max-width: 700px;
  }

  .hero-text {
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    max-width: 650px;
  }

  .hero-links {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    margin-top: 1.75rem;
  }

  .hero-link {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--accent);
    transition: color 0.2s ease;
  }

  .hero-link:hover {
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  .dendrons-strip {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    margin: 0 0 0 0;
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.03em;
  }

  .dendrons-founder {
    color: var(--text-primary);
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .dendrons-founder a {
    color: var(--text-primary);
    text-decoration: none;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.3);
    transition: border-color 0.2s ease;
  }

  .dendrons-founder a:hover {
    border-color: var(--accent);
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  .dendrons-dot {
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  .dendrons-badge {
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
  }

  .stat-bar {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(5, 1fr);
    gap: 1rem;
    margin: 2rem 0 0 0;
    padding: 1.5rem 0;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.15);
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.15);
  }
  .stat { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; }
  .stat-number { font-size: 1.4rem; font-weight: 600; }
  .stat-label { font-size: 0.75rem; opacity: 0.7; line-height: 1.4; }

  /* Bio section */
  .bio {
    padding-top: 0.75rem;
  }

  .bio p {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.8;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .dendrons-card {
    border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 25%, transparent);
    border-radius: 10px;
    padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 5%, transparent);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }

  .dendrons-card-top {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    justify-content: space-between;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }

  .dendrons-name {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: color 0.2s ease;
  }

  .dendrons-name:hover {
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  .dendrons-type {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
  }

  .dendrons-tagline {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin: 0;
    font-style: italic;
  }

  .dendrons-card-badges {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }

  .dendrons-pill {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    padding: 0.25rem 0.65rem;
    border-radius: 20px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.15);
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  .dendrons-pill--anthropic {
    border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 40%, transparent);
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  .bio-contact {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 1rem;
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .bio-contact a {
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .stat-bar { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .hero-banner {
      height: 220px;
    }

    .hero-title {
      font-size: 1.75rem;
    }
  }
</style>
